And you just put up with it?

295
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:00,400
What else can I do?

296
00:15:00,560 --> 00:15:01,560
She's the legit daughter,

297
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:02,640
what am I?

298
00:15:03,760 --> 00:15:05,000
So what if she's the legit daughter?

299
00:15:05,520 --> 00:15:06,760
I'm a legit daughter too!

300
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:08,920
I've never bullied anyone.

301
00:15:21,400 --> 00:15:22,840
Do you know what Cao Cao's

302
00:15:22,840 --> 00:15:24,520
two biggest mistakes in his life were?

303
00:15:29,520 --> 00:15:31,360
One was mistakenly executing Cai Mao,

304
00:15:31,520 --> 00:15:32,880
the other was letting Guan Yu go.

305
00:15:34,160 --> 00:15:35,600
Cai Mao should've been put to good use.

306
00:15:36,240 --> 00:15:36,960
But Guan Yu

307
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:38,960
should've been killed.

308
00:15:41,400 --> 00:15:42,440
Don't you agree?

309
00:15:45,520 --> 00:15:46,200
Second Aunt,

310
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:47,920
this opera is really good.

311
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:49,240
Which troupe is it from?

312
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:51,320
It's the Spring Grass Troupe
from south of the city.

313
00:16:11,400 --> 00:16:13,280
This is truly outrageous!

314
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:21,760
I need to change clothes.

315
00:16:22,040 --> 00:16:23,240
Miss, this way please.

316
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:42,760
I need to change too.

317
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:43,720
Wait a moment!

318
00:16:44,120 --> 00:16:44,960
Let's go together

319
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:46,320
after this act.

320
00:17:02,520 --> 00:17:03,400
Running away without a fight,

321
00:17:03,680 --> 00:17:04,440
doesn't suit you.

322
00:17:06,720 --> 00:17:08,359
Can you stop following me?

323
00:17:10,040 --> 00:17:11,079
Your handkerchief…

324
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:11,839
Young Lord,

325
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:12,960
I can't afford to offend you!

326
00:17:13,079 --> 00:17:14,359
And I don't want another whipping!

327
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:15,599
Please just let me go,

328
00:17:15,599 --> 00:17:16,359
can you?

329
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:18,680
You can't afford to offend me,

330
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:20,359
so you can afford Chen Yanyun?

331
00:17:22,760 --> 00:17:23,680
What did you say?

332
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:25,720
Don't talk nonsense!

333
00:17:26,319 --> 00:17:27,200
Nonsense?

334
00:17:27,680 --> 00:17:29,680
New Year's Eve, City God Temple festival,

335
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:31,680
I saw it myself

336
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:32,560
that Chen guy

337
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:34,320
jumped into the river to save you.

338
00:17:35,840 --> 00:17:36,760
That never happened!

339
00:17:37,520 --> 00:17:38,720
You're spreading rumors!

340
00:17:39,520 --> 00:17:40,360
If I'm spreading rumors,

341
00:17:40,680 --> 00:17:41,560
may I be struck by lightning.

342
00:17:42,240 --> 00:17:43,160
And if you're lying,

343
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:44,440
you too.

344
00:17:45,240 --> 00:17:46,200
Meeting you already

345
00:17:46,600 --> 00:17:48,120
feels like I've been struck by lightning!

346
00:17:49,840 --> 00:17:50,600
There's a higher spot,

347
00:17:50,880 --> 00:17:52,240
go stand there and say it if you dare!

348
00:17:53,480 --> 00:17:54,440
You think I won't?

349
00:17:54,840 --> 00:17:55,960
Of course you dare!

350
00:17:56,600 --> 00:17:57,640
You'd dare anything!

351
00:17:57,800 --> 00:17:58,480
You are

352
00:17:58,480 --> 00:17:59,880
the noble Young Lord!

353
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:01,400
What wouldn't you dare?

354
00:18:02,200 --> 00:18:03,000
What are people like us

355
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:04,440
worth in your eyes?

356
00:18:04,680 --> 00:18:05,680
You just say

357
00:18:05,720 --> 00:18:06,400
and do whatever you want!

358
00:18:06,680 --> 00:18:07,560
Gu Jinzhao,

359
00:18:07,880 --> 00:18:08,640
you've gone too far!

360
00:18:08,720 --> 00:18:09,840
So what if I have?

361
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:11,240
Kill me if you can!

362
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:11,800
You…

363
00:18:24,120 --> 00:18:25,720
You ungrateful thing!

364
00:18:27,360 --> 00:18:28,640
If I weren't considering

365
00:18:29,040 --> 00:18:30,360
you once saved my life…

366
00:18:35,120 --> 00:18:36,560
Xian, Jinzhao.

367
00:18:36,800 --> 00:18:37,720
Aunt.

368
00:18:40,120 --> 00:18:41,320
What are you two doing here?

369
00:18:44,280 --> 00:18:45,080
Her handkerchief fell,

370
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:46,440
I picked it up for her.

371
00:18:47,280 --> 00:18:48,120
I'm returning it now.

372
00:18:50,320 --> 00:18:51,400
Young Lord is mistaken,

373
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:52,800
this isn't mine.

374
00:18:54,080 --> 00:18:55,400
I clearly saw it was yours!

375
00:18:55,520 --> 00:18:56,760
How can you lie like that?

376
00:18:57,160 --> 00:18:58,080
How is it not yours?

377
00:18:58,280 --> 00:18:59,440
How could I not

378
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:00,720
recognize my own thing?

379
00:19:03,360 --> 00:19:04,360
It's cold in the courtyard,

380
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:06,520
I'll take my leave, Aunt,

381
00:19:06,520 --> 00:19:07,400
Young Lord.

382
00:19:07,560 --> 00:19:08,360
I was going to go

383
00:19:08,360 --> 00:19:09,640
get my hand warmer anyway.

384
00:19:12,920 --> 00:19:13,600
Gu Jinzhao!

385
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:14,640
Enough.

386
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:16,720
She said it's not hers.

387
00:19:16,840 --> 00:19:17,480
Are you going

388
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:18,560
to force her to take it?

389
00:19:19,280 --> 00:19:20,200
What handkerchief?

390
00:19:20,520 --> 00:19:21,120
Give it to me.

391
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:23,680
Why would I give it to you?

392
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:25,320
I picked it up.

393
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:28,520
Where are you going?
The feast is about to start!

394
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:31,000
All grown up now,

395
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:32,360
still no sense of propriety.

396
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:33,720
Miss,

397
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:35,720
but Young Lord's already of age.

398
00:19:36,240 --> 00:19:37,000
Yes,

399
00:19:37,440 --> 00:19:38,200
he's of age.

400
00:19:46,240 --> 00:19:47,080
That's not fair!

401
00:19:47,080 --> 00:19:48,040
You are two people!

402
00:19:56,440 --> 00:19:57,600
Ma'am,

403
00:19:57,640 --> 00:19:58,680
ladies,

404
00:19:58,720 --> 00:19:59,520
young masters!

405
00:19:59,520 --> 00:20:00,760
The snacks are here!

406
00:20:02,560 --> 00:20:03,720
- 30,000 coins.
- Snacks are here!

407
00:20:23,640 --> 00:20:25,040
The handkerchief's still with Xian.

408
00:20:25,480 --> 00:20:26,640
If he goes crazy

409
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:27,680
and takes it out,

410
00:20:27,840 --> 00:20:29,240
and someone notices

411
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:30,600
my stitching matches it,

412
00:20:30,920 --> 00:20:31,640
I'm in trouble.

413
00:20:31,880 --> 00:20:33,240
You're all set, right?

414
00:20:35,880 --> 00:20:36,920
Nicely done!

415
00:20:39,160 --> 00:20:40,280
Lan's lotus

416
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:41,320
is well done too.

417
00:20:42,960 --> 00:20:43,760
Jinzhao.

418
00:20:44,880 --> 00:20:46,360
What's wrong?

419
00:20:47,080 --> 00:20:47,880
Second Aunt,

420
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:49,240
my embroidery isn't good,

421
00:20:49,480 --> 00:20:50,440
not worth showing.

422
00:20:51,720 --> 00:20:53,040
It's fine.

423
00:20:53,400 --> 00:20:54,560
Ma'am just likes

424
00:20:54,840 --> 00:20:56,760
girls doing needlework.

425
00:20:57,080 --> 00:20:58,480
So we're all just

426
00:20:58,760 --> 00:21:00,120
keeping her entertained.

427
00:21:00,520 --> 00:21:01,520
Don't take it seriously.

428
00:21:01,800 --> 00:21:03,000
Thank you for the advice, Second Aunt.

429
00:21:03,760 --> 00:21:04,800
Second Madam, please come quick!

430
00:21:05,920 --> 00:21:06,840
Coming!

431
00:21:07,600 --> 00:21:08,600
Keep stitching.

432
00:21:14,480 --> 00:21:15,440
Lan,

433
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:17,080
how is

434
00:21:17,240 --> 00:21:18,920
your lotus so good?

435
00:21:19,400 --> 00:21:21,280
I just learned a bit from my mother.

436
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:22,960
Your mother's that good too?

437
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:24,640
Isn't she from a merchant family?

438
00:21:26,840 --> 00:21:27,520
Oh right,

439
00:21:27,760 --> 00:21:29,400
you mean "mother".

440
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:34,360
- Uncle.
- What are you looking at?

441
00:21:34,360 --> 00:21:35,080
Try this pastry.

442
00:21:35,800 --> 00:21:36,800
Just because of my

443
00:21:36,800 --> 00:21:37,960
"merchant's daughter" comment?

444
00:21:37,960 --> 00:21:38,520
[Jinxian,]

445
00:21:38,760 --> 00:21:39,200
[your turn!]

446
00:21:39,200 --> 00:21:40,800
Did it hit your nerve too?

447
00:21:46,960 --> 00:21:48,480
Why are you shaking your head?

448
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:49,840
You people

449
00:21:49,840 --> 00:21:50,920
from merchant families

450
00:21:51,160 --> 00:21:52,640
are always so petty!

451
00:21:52,840 --> 00:21:53,480
Say it

452
00:21:53,720 --> 00:21:55,040
if you've got the guts.

453
00:21:56,080 --> 00:21:57,840
Since you act so high and mighty,

454
00:21:58,240 --> 00:21:59,240
why are you wearing

455
00:21:59,240 --> 00:22:01,000
a fake gold cicada hairpin?

456
00:22:03,920 --> 00:22:04,760
What did you say?

457
00:22:05,080 --> 00:22:06,360
Fake?

458
00:22:06,960 --> 00:22:08,120
Then I'll say it straight.

459
00:22:08,960 --> 00:22:10,240
This gold cicada hairpin

460
00:22:10,240 --> 00:22:11,680
is this autumn's design

461
00:22:11,800 --> 00:22:13,080
from my maternal family's jewelry shop.

462
00:22:13,640 --> 00:22:14,560
Just that cicada alone

463
00:22:14,720 --> 00:22:16,200
used three taels of gold.

464
00:22:16,840 --> 00:22:18,000
If I'm not mistaken,

465
00:22:18,320 --> 00:22:19,600
the one you're wearing

466
00:22:19,720 --> 00:22:21,360
is hollow, gold-plated.

467
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:22,760
Don't believe me? Look,

468
00:22:23,680 --> 00:22:24,880
the gold on the sides

469
00:22:25,240 --> 00:22:25,840
is already worn off.

470
00:22:28,720 --> 00:22:29,840
Nonsense!

471
00:22:30,680 --> 00:22:31,600
Nonsense or not,

472
00:22:31,600 --> 00:22:33,040
you know in your heart.

473
00:22:33,120 --> 00:22:34,760
If you want proof,

474
00:22:35,200 --> 00:22:36,640
take it off

475
00:22:37,040 --> 00:22:37,840
and drop it in water.

476
00:22:38,560 --> 00:22:40,480
If it floats,

477
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:42,040
that'd be something.

478
00:22:46,760 --> 00:22:47,560
Girls,

479
00:22:49,760 --> 00:22:50,800
how's the embroidery?

480
00:22:52,080 --> 00:22:52,960
Grandma.

481
00:22:55,800 --> 00:22:56,760
This lotus

482
00:22:57,080 --> 00:22:58,600
looks almost alive.

483
00:22:59,400 --> 00:23:00,320
You must

484
00:23:00,520 --> 00:23:01,640
have practiced a lot.

485
00:23:02,360 --> 00:23:03,360
Thank you, Grandma.

486
00:23:03,840 --> 00:23:04,680
A koi?

487
00:23:06,880 --> 00:23:08,440
A bit weaker than the lotus.

488
00:23:08,960 --> 00:23:10,280
Grandma!

489
00:23:11,520 --> 00:23:12,400
Still not bad.

490
00:23:13,920 --> 00:23:15,160
How's Jinzhao's work?

491
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:16,520
Let me have a look.

492
00:23:16,680 --> 00:23:17,320
Grandma,

493
00:23:17,560 --> 00:23:18,960
my skills are poor,

494
00:23:19,360 --> 00:23:20,360
it's not well done.

495
00:23:22,040 --> 00:23:23,040
Even if it's not good,

496
00:23:23,240 --> 00:23:24,720
you can still show it!

497
00:23:26,520 --> 00:23:27,600
No way, Jinzhao,

498
00:23:28,280 --> 00:23:28,600
this…

499
00:23:28,840 --> 00:23:30,120
did you really make it?

500
00:23:33,040 --> 00:23:34,640
What's this supposed to be?

501
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:35,560
Look at this!

502
00:23:37,680 --> 00:23:38,120
This…

503
00:23:39,680 --> 00:23:40,320
This is…

504
00:23:41,080 --> 00:23:42,240
It's a butterfly.

505
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:43,960
A butterfly?

506
00:23:44,200 --> 00:23:44,840
I thought

507
00:23:44,840 --> 00:23:46,320
it was a moth!

508
00:23:47,640 --> 00:23:48,160
What,

509
00:23:48,480 --> 00:23:48,880
your mother

510
00:23:48,880 --> 00:23:50,120
never taught you needlework?

511
00:23:52,280 --> 00:23:53,000
Oh right,

512
00:23:53,240 --> 00:23:54,920
you were kicked out as a child

513
00:23:54,960 --> 00:23:56,680
and raised by your grandmother.

514
00:23:59,640 --> 00:24:01,600
I heard the Ji family
is the richest in Tongzhou.

515
00:24:01,800 --> 00:24:02,640
Well,

516
00:24:03,040 --> 00:24:03,760
what's the point

517
00:24:03,760 --> 00:24:04,680
of a big dowry?

518
00:24:05,000 --> 00:24:06,040
Proper upbringing still matters.

519
00:24:06,040 --> 00:24:06,560
It's Jinzhao's.

520
00:24:07,000 --> 00:24:07,960
With skills like that,

521
00:24:08,120 --> 00:24:09,160
how will you face

522
00:24:09,280 --> 00:24:10,200
your in-laws later?

523
00:24:10,880 --> 00:24:11,680
Lian,

524
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:14,320
the Ji family in Tongzhou are your elders,

525
00:24:14,760 --> 00:24:16,240
how can you talk like that?

526
00:24:16,840 --> 00:24:17,440
Exactly.

527
00:24:17,880 --> 00:24:19,040
My poor skills are on me,

528
00:24:19,160 --> 00:24:20,400
what does it have
to do with my grandparents?

529
00:24:21,280 --> 00:24:21,880
Right.

530
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:23,960
That wasn't fair, Lian.

531
00:24:24,520 --> 00:24:25,680
I heard

532
00:24:25,720 --> 00:24:26,560
Mrs. Ji

533
00:24:26,560 --> 00:24:28,160
hired Ms. Xue

534
00:24:28,480 --> 00:24:29,800
from Silken Pavilion

535
00:24:29,800 --> 00:24:30,640
just to teach

536
00:24:30,640 --> 00:24:32,080
her needlework.

537
00:24:33,160 --> 00:24:33,760
Then why

538
00:24:33,760 --> 00:24:35,200
is it so crude?

539
00:24:35,560 --> 00:24:37,280
Is that all Silken Pavilion can teach?

540
00:24:38,560 --> 00:24:40,600
Maybe you're new here,

541
00:24:40,680 --> 00:24:41,640
just playing it down, right?

542
00:24:42,160 --> 00:24:43,360
We're all family,

543
00:24:43,440 --> 00:24:44,720
no need to be so modest.

544
00:24:45,560 --> 00:24:46,440
I happen to have

545
00:24:46,440 --> 00:24:48,200
a handkerchief she embroidered herself.

546
00:24:48,640 --> 00:24:49,720
You'll see once you look.

547
00:24:52,960 --> 00:24:53,480
Mother,

548
00:24:53,960 --> 00:24:54,600
look!

549
00:24:54,800 --> 00:24:56,160
This orchid,

550
00:24:56,680 --> 00:24:58,120
both form and spirit are perfect!

551
00:24:59,120 --> 00:25:00,680
So lifelike.

552
00:25:01,480 --> 00:25:02,360
What's that she stitched?

553
00:25:02,600 --> 00:25:03,320
Let me see.

554
00:25:06,840 --> 00:25:07,880
Jinzhao stitched it.

555
00:25:15,760 --> 00:25:16,880
It's really well done.

556
00:25:17,800 --> 00:25:18,480
Jinzhao,

557
00:25:19,040 --> 00:25:21,080
did you really embroider this?

558
00:25:23,520 --> 00:25:24,280
Yes.

559
00:25:32,680 --> 00:25:33,560
My luck's

560
00:25:33,640 --> 00:25:34,440
great today!

561
00:25:37,600 --> 00:25:38,360
Jinzhao.

562
00:25:40,760 --> 00:25:41,400
Jinxian,

563
00:25:42,000 --> 00:25:42,480
I need to speak

564
00:25:42,480 --> 00:25:43,840
to the Young Lord alone.

565
00:25:45,400 --> 00:25:46,320
Okay, I'll leave you to chat.

566
00:25:49,720 --> 00:25:50,440
Mad?

567
00:25:51,640 --> 00:25:53,080
Mad I made you admit

568
00:25:53,640 --> 00:25:54,640
the handkerchief was yours?

569
00:25:56,720 --> 00:25:57,600
Get this straight,

570
00:25:57,960 --> 00:25:59,440
I was helping you.

571
00:26:00,640 --> 00:26:01,960
Thanks for the help, Young Lord.

572
00:26:02,400 --> 00:26:04,400
Next time, please don't.

573
00:26:06,000 --> 00:26:07,080
So I was wrong?

574
00:26:07,680 --> 00:26:08,360
You gave my handkerchief

575
00:26:08,360 --> 00:26:09,320
to Lan,

576
00:26:09,600 --> 00:26:10,480
what do you think she'll think?

577
00:26:10,840 --> 00:26:11,840
So that's what you're worried about?

578
00:26:13,040 --> 00:26:14,160
She won't say anything.

579
00:26:15,720 --> 00:26:16,880
How do you know she won't?

580
00:26:18,120 --> 00:26:18,920
When I speak,

581
00:26:19,280 --> 00:26:19,840
who dares not listen,

582
00:26:20,200 --> 00:26:21,240
besides you?

583
00:26:22,360 --> 00:26:23,360
What about Aunt?

584
00:26:24,480 --> 00:26:25,240
She was there.

585
00:26:25,800 --> 00:26:26,720
She saw

586
00:26:26,720 --> 00:26:27,520
what happened.

587
00:26:28,160 --> 00:26:28,760
Jinzhao,

588
00:26:28,760 --> 00:26:29,920
why are you so fussy?

589
00:26:30,080 --> 00:26:31,040
What are you afraid of?

590
00:26:31,280 --> 00:26:32,240
She's my sister!

591
00:26:34,120 --> 00:26:35,480
You wouldn't understand.

592
00:26:50,200 --> 00:26:51,640
Jinzhao, where are you going?

593
00:26:55,680 --> 00:26:56,480
Slow down.

594
00:27:23,360 --> 00:27:24,440
Everything has its fate.

595
00:27:25,080 --> 00:27:25,720
This cat

596
00:27:26,120 --> 00:27:27,040
was probably bitten

597
00:27:27,040 --> 00:27:27,720
in a fight.

598
00:27:28,360 --> 00:27:29,080
It won't live long.

599
00:27:30,160 --> 00:27:31,440
Saving it now

600
00:27:31,840 --> 00:27:32,520
will only make it

601
00:27:32,520 --> 00:27:33,480
suffer more.

602
00:27:34,200 --> 00:27:35,200
So by your logic,

603
00:27:35,200 --> 00:27:36,320
I shouldn't have saved you

604
00:27:36,440 --> 00:27:37,280
at Blessed Fane either.

605
00:27:38,280 --> 00:27:39,880
You've got your own fate anyway.

606
00:27:54,120 --> 00:27:55,280
Do you want to save it

607
00:27:55,440 --> 00:27:57,000
or put it out of its misery?

608
00:28:30,440 --> 00:28:30,920
My lord.

609
00:28:51,280 --> 00:28:52,160
What are you staring at?

610
00:28:52,840 --> 00:28:54,000
Always causing me trouble.

611
00:28:54,720 --> 00:28:55,480
Didn't expect you

612
00:28:55,480 --> 00:28:57,120
to be so patient with a cat,

613
00:28:57,520 --> 00:28:58,920
yet so cruel to people.

614
00:29:00,520 --> 00:29:01,440
You've got a death wish?

615
00:29:02,080 --> 00:29:03,640
Want another whipping?

616
00:29:05,880 --> 00:29:07,440
Looks like you really resent me.

617
00:29:07,960 --> 00:29:09,160
Wouldn't you?

618
00:29:09,480 --> 00:29:10,680
I didn't provoke you at all

619
00:29:10,680 --> 00:29:11,760
and still got whipped.

620
00:29:12,400 --> 00:29:13,480
And that Mr. Zhang.

621
00:29:14,160 --> 00:29:15,480
He fell seriously ill

622
00:29:15,680 --> 00:29:16,920
just because of your prank.

623
00:29:17,280 --> 00:29:18,280
He's totally innocent!

624
00:29:19,520 --> 00:29:20,360
He's innocent?

625
00:29:20,560 --> 00:29:21,400
I'm the innocent one!

626
00:29:21,800 --> 00:29:22,560
If you hadn't

627
00:29:22,560 --> 00:29:23,600
stood me up for no reason,

628
00:29:24,360 --> 00:29:25,680
why would I lose my temper?

629
00:29:26,200 --> 00:29:27,080
Stood you up?

630
00:29:27,560 --> 00:29:28,800
When did I ever do that?

631
00:29:29,840 --> 00:29:30,840
Playing dumb?

632
00:29:31,560 --> 00:29:32,720
I sent you an invitation

633
00:29:33,800 --> 00:29:35,040
and you snubbed me.

634
00:29:35,840 --> 00:29:36,520
What,

635
00:29:37,480 --> 00:29:38,640
was I supposed to tolerate that?

636
00:29:38,880 --> 00:29:39,920
Invitation?

637
00:29:40,560 --> 00:29:42,200
I never got anything.

638
00:29:46,880 --> 00:29:47,680
Xianhuai.

639
00:29:56,880 --> 00:29:57,600
So,

640
00:29:57,880 --> 00:29:58,440
the handkerchief

641
00:29:58,440 --> 00:29:59,880
was given to the Young Lord
by Ms. Jinzhao?

642
00:30:00,280 --> 00:30:00,600
Then…

643
00:30:02,240 --> 00:30:04,160
Wouldn't that be a private exchange?

644
00:30:04,400 --> 00:30:05,600
It's not her first time

645
00:30:05,600 --> 00:30:06,640
doing that.

646
00:30:21,280 --> 00:30:22,240
Jinzhao, you're here.

647
00:30:22,480 --> 00:30:23,480
Still up so late?

648
00:30:23,680 --> 00:30:24,240
Come in.

649
00:30:25,240 --> 00:30:26,360
I came to thank you

650
00:30:26,920 --> 00:30:28,320
for speaking up for me.

651
00:30:29,560 --> 00:30:30,480
You mean

652
00:30:30,480 --> 00:30:31,320
the embroidery thing?

653
00:30:31,520 --> 00:30:32,840
We're sisters.

654
00:30:33,040 --> 00:30:34,600
They were mocking your grandmother,

655
00:30:34,720 --> 00:30:35,960
of course I'd defend you.

656
00:30:37,160 --> 00:30:38,080
So I won't pursue

657
00:30:38,080 --> 00:30:39,680
you hiding Ye Xian's invitation

658
00:30:40,000 --> 00:30:41,160
from me.

659
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:47,160
What invitation?

660
00:30:48,160 --> 00:30:48,720
Well,

661
00:30:49,040 --> 00:30:50,280
whether Ye Xian pursues it,

662
00:30:50,440 --> 00:30:51,360
that's another matter.

663
00:30:52,200 --> 00:30:53,440
What are you talking about?

664
00:30:55,720 --> 00:30:58,320
When I first returned,

665
00:30:58,520 --> 00:31:00,160
you had no issue with me.

666
00:31:00,880 --> 00:31:01,280
I…

667
00:31:01,640 --> 00:31:03,320
I suppose lately

668
00:31:03,320 --> 00:31:04,480
things have changed in the house.

669
00:31:04,960 --> 00:31:05,800
Because of me,

670
00:31:06,080 --> 00:31:08,000
Concubine Song took some losses.

671
00:31:09,160 --> 00:31:10,720
So you resent me.

672
00:31:10,840 --> 00:31:12,040
You think my return

673
00:31:12,200 --> 00:31:13,040
got in your way.

674
00:31:14,200 --> 00:31:16,160
I've never thought that.

675
00:31:17,480 --> 00:31:19,120
I'm a straightforward person.

676
00:31:20,280 --> 00:31:21,240
Yes, I'm the legit daughter

677
00:31:21,360 --> 00:31:22,080
and you're not.

678
00:31:22,680 --> 00:31:24,040
But since I was a baby,

679
00:31:24,200 --> 00:31:25,640
I grew up at my grandmother's.

680
00:31:26,440 --> 00:31:27,240
I never lived a day

681
00:31:27,240 --> 00:31:28,040
as a true legit daughter.

682
00:31:28,520 --> 00:31:29,040
And you,

683
00:31:29,480 --> 00:31:30,480
since birth,

684
00:31:30,800 --> 00:31:32,320
you were the only miss in the house.

685
00:31:33,000 --> 00:31:33,920
Not legit,

686
00:31:34,320 --> 00:31:35,560
yet treated like one.

687
00:31:36,120 --> 00:31:37,400
What I'm saying

688
00:31:37,760 --> 00:31:38,680
is just to tell you

689
00:31:39,760 --> 00:31:41,640
that in my eyes there's no such divide.

690
00:31:42,360 --> 00:31:44,040
You don't need to see me as a rival.

691
00:31:46,080 --> 00:31:47,080
Jinzhao, that's really unfair

692
00:31:47,080 --> 00:31:48,400
of you to say.

693
00:31:49,360 --> 00:31:50,680
How am I supposed to take that?

694
00:31:53,160 --> 00:31:54,200
I've said my piece.

695
00:31:54,720 --> 00:31:56,000
If you take it in, good.

696
00:31:56,320 --> 00:31:57,360
If not,

697
00:31:57,600 --> 00:31:58,520
and you keep stirring trouble,

698
00:31:59,160 --> 00:31:59,920
I'm not the type

699
00:31:59,920 --> 00:32:01,080
to repay evil with kindness.

700
00:32:01,920 --> 00:32:03,240
Qingpu, let's go.

701
00:32:08,720 --> 00:32:10,040
So fake and pretentious!

702
00:32:10,760 --> 00:32:12,120
I don't believe
that if roles were reversed,

703
00:32:12,280 --> 00:32:13,600
she could still be so detached!

704
00:32:14,080 --> 00:32:14,960
Just talking big

705
00:32:14,960 --> 00:32:15,760
without feeling it herself.

706
00:32:17,560 --> 00:32:18,000
Let's go!

707
00:32:25,280 --> 00:32:26,160
[Didn't expect you]

708
00:32:26,160 --> 00:32:27,840
[to be so patient with a cat,]

709
00:32:28,160 --> 00:32:29,600
[yet so cruel to people.]

710
00:32:35,400 --> 00:32:36,120
Miss.

711
00:32:37,800 --> 00:32:38,440
Sis.

712
00:32:39,560 --> 00:32:40,640
What are you doing outside?

713
00:32:40,960 --> 00:32:42,040
Aren't you cold?

714
00:32:43,200 --> 00:32:43,840
Cold is good,

715
00:32:44,120 --> 00:32:44,800
keeps the mind clear.

716
00:32:45,960 --> 00:32:47,080
Always full of strange ideas.

717
00:32:48,480 --> 00:32:49,240
You're afraid of the cold,

718
00:32:49,640 --> 00:32:50,720
I'll help you inside.

719
00:32:55,560 --> 00:32:56,120
Sis,

720
00:32:56,320 --> 00:32:56,880
please sit.

721
00:33:04,160 --> 00:33:05,960
Before the New Year,
I attended a banquet

722
00:33:05,960 --> 00:33:06,960
for Lord Wuning's birthday banquet,

723
00:33:07,200 --> 00:33:08,680
and ran into Viscount Weiyuan's wife.

724
00:33:09,200 --> 00:33:09,800
Only then did I know

725
00:33:09,800 --> 00:33:11,240
their second son is already engaged

726
00:33:11,440 --> 00:33:12,120
to the youngest daughter

727
00:33:12,120 --> 00:33:13,240
of Lord Wuning,

728
00:33:13,400 --> 00:33:14,400
Qiu Fang.

729
00:33:14,680 --> 00:33:16,880
I remember he's about your age,

730
00:33:17,280 --> 00:33:18,800
maybe even a few months younger.

731
00:33:19,760 --> 00:33:20,680
To be honest,

732
00:33:21,400 --> 00:33:23,280
mother also mentioned your marriage.

733
00:33:23,960 --> 00:33:24,920
I said,

734
00:33:25,480 --> 00:33:27,120
Xian's always had
his own ideas since childhood,

735
00:33:27,440 --> 00:33:28,120
so this

736
00:33:28,400 --> 00:33:29,880
should be his decision.

737
00:33:30,280 --> 00:33:31,160
Do you think so?

738
00:33:33,080 --> 00:33:33,920
Why are you laughing?

739
00:33:36,480 --> 00:33:37,400
I'm just laughing

740
00:33:37,600 --> 00:33:39,000
that you always like

741
00:33:39,000 --> 00:33:40,320
to beat around the bush.

742
00:33:41,280 --> 00:33:42,320
Doesn't it get tiring?

743
00:33:42,920 --> 00:33:43,560
Fine,

744
00:33:44,040 --> 00:33:45,160
I'll be direct then.

745
00:33:46,800 --> 00:33:47,920
You're of age now,

746
00:33:48,240 --> 00:33:49,360
and you're the only heir of the family.

747
00:33:50,040 --> 00:33:51,760
Mother and father plan

748
00:33:51,920 --> 00:33:53,160
to start looking for a match this spring.

749
00:33:53,520 --> 00:33:54,760
Get married early,

750
00:33:55,000 --> 00:33:56,120
so you can carry on

751
00:33:56,120 --> 00:33:57,040
the family line.

752
00:33:59,640 --> 00:34:00,280
Yeah.

753
00:34:00,840 --> 00:34:02,040
Even if I die early,

754
00:34:02,720 --> 00:34:03,760
you'll all feel more at ease, right?

755
00:34:04,080 --> 00:34:05,240
What are you saying?

756
00:34:06,920 --> 00:34:08,480
Since you care so much
about continuing the family line,

757
00:34:08,880 --> 00:34:10,120
go have your own children.

758
00:34:10,880 --> 00:34:11,679
Even letting your husband

759
00:34:11,679 --> 00:34:12,840
take concubines is fine.

760
00:34:13,320 --> 00:34:14,520
Why drag me into it?

761
00:34:15,040 --> 00:34:16,120
I can't handle you anymore?

762
00:34:23,560 --> 00:34:24,560
You wouldn't happen

763
00:34:25,040 --> 00:34:26,760
to like a Gu girl, would you?

764
00:34:32,480 --> 00:34:33,760
Is it that Jinzhao?

765
00:34:36,679 --> 00:34:37,600
So what if it is?

766
00:34:38,719 --> 00:34:39,480
And what if it isn't?

767
00:34:39,639 --> 00:34:40,679
If it isn't, good.

768
00:34:41,239 --> 00:34:42,040
If it is,

769
00:34:42,320 --> 00:34:42,920
then I advise you,

770
00:34:42,920 --> 00:34:44,120
forget it early.

771
00:34:44,400 --> 00:34:45,360
You're the heir,

772
00:34:45,639 --> 00:34:46,520
destined to inherit

773
00:34:46,520 --> 00:34:47,719
the entire Marquis Manor.

774
00:34:48,159 --> 00:34:48,960
A girl from the Gu family,

775
00:34:49,320 --> 00:34:50,239
let alone Jinzhao,

776
00:34:50,440 --> 00:34:51,199
even Lian wouldn't be

777
00:34:51,199 --> 00:34:52,280
a match for you.

778
00:34:53,199 --> 00:34:54,280
I shouldn't have

779
00:34:54,560 --> 00:34:55,280
let you stay

780
00:34:55,280 --> 00:34:56,400
at the Gu Manor so often.

781
00:34:57,960 --> 00:34:58,880
All these girls

782
00:34:58,920 --> 00:35:00,120
have only caused unnecessary trouble.

783
00:35:01,840 --> 00:35:02,520
I'll keep this

784
00:35:02,880 --> 00:35:04,000
from our parents for now.

785
00:35:04,400 --> 00:35:05,680
But you'd better know it.

786
00:35:06,160 --> 00:35:07,400
If father and mother find out,

787
00:35:07,400 --> 00:35:08,520
you know what the consequences will be.

788
00:35:08,920 --> 00:35:10,120
If you truly care for her,

789
00:35:10,240 --> 00:35:11,280
you should cut those feelings off

790
00:35:11,280 --> 00:35:12,080
early.

791
00:35:14,120 --> 00:35:14,960
Xianhuai!

792
00:35:17,600 --> 00:35:18,160
Miss.

793
00:35:18,520 --> 00:35:19,880
Go pack the Young Lord's things,

794
00:35:20,120 --> 00:35:20,920
he's returning to Marquis Manor.

795
00:35:22,440 --> 00:35:22,920
This…

796
00:35:23,480 --> 00:35:23,920
What,

797
00:35:24,200 --> 00:35:25,720
do my words not carry weight anymore?

798
00:35:25,760 --> 00:35:26,520
I wouldn't dare.

799
00:35:26,760 --> 00:35:27,400
I'll…

800
00:35:27,960 --> 00:35:28,880
go pack now.

801
00:35:44,880 --> 00:35:46,160
People always say gold and silver

802
00:35:46,320 --> 00:35:47,640
can't compare to something made by hand.

803
00:35:48,520 --> 00:35:49,720
Giving these to Mr. Chen,

804
00:35:50,040 --> 00:35:50,920
let alone him,

805
00:35:51,240 --> 00:35:52,400
I even find it tacky.

806
00:35:54,200 --> 00:35:55,520
[Mr. Jinrong's here!]

807
00:35:58,480 --> 00:35:59,320
Greetings, Jinzhao.

808
00:36:02,720 --> 00:36:04,400
You're…

809
00:36:05,920 --> 00:36:07,400
Just picking out a few suitable gifts

810
00:36:07,640 --> 00:36:09,080
for some social visits.

811
00:36:13,880 --> 00:36:14,720
Jinrong,

812
00:36:15,120 --> 00:36:16,000
what is it?

813
00:36:16,920 --> 00:36:17,560
Here's the thing.

814
00:36:18,600 --> 00:36:19,720
A while ago,

815
00:36:19,720 --> 00:36:21,160
I went to Yong'an Bridge

816
00:36:21,400 --> 00:36:22,800
and accidentally saw you

817
00:36:22,800 --> 00:36:23,880
with Mr. Chen's nephew,

818
00:36:23,880 --> 00:36:24,640
Chen Xuanqing.

819
00:36:27,680 --> 00:36:28,720
Well, don't misunderstand.

820
00:36:29,280 --> 00:36:30,600
I saw it,

821
00:36:30,840 --> 00:36:31,760
but I won't spread it.

822
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:33,160
Not even

823
00:36:33,160 --> 00:36:34,120
to father and mother.

824
00:36:34,360 --> 00:36:35,360
Don't worry.

825
00:36:40,320 --> 00:36:41,400
A few days ago,

826
00:36:42,000 --> 00:36:43,880
you wanted to borrow 200 taels from me,

827
00:36:44,480 --> 00:36:46,240
I've got it ready.

828
00:36:46,680 --> 00:36:47,200
Well…

829
00:36:47,920 --> 00:36:49,240
Thank you, Jinzhao!

830
00:36:51,480 --> 00:36:52,320
But,

831
00:36:52,600 --> 00:36:54,400
since it's a loan, there are rules.

832
00:36:54,840 --> 00:36:56,320
Even between siblings,

833
00:36:56,760 --> 00:36:59,240
we still need signatures and fingerprints.

834
00:36:59,720 --> 00:37:01,160
Of course.

835
00:37:01,920 --> 00:37:04,040
Borrowed: 200 taels.

836
00:37:04,640 --> 00:37:05,440
Any collateral?

837
00:37:06,120 --> 00:37:07,200
I…

838
00:37:09,640 --> 00:37:10,920
If you don't have anything suitable,

839
00:37:11,160 --> 00:37:12,000
the jade bracelet

840
00:37:12,000 --> 00:37:13,520
you gave me that day will do, alright?

841
00:37:14,240 --> 00:37:14,800
Alright!

842
00:37:16,360 --> 00:37:17,720
You really are straightforward.

843
00:37:28,520 --> 00:37:30,040
Six-month term,

844
00:37:30,120 --> 00:37:32,440
with three months' interest
added upon maturity…

845
00:37:34,560 --> 00:37:35,160
This…

846
00:37:35,680 --> 00:37:36,920
This is "9 out, 13 return"?

847
00:37:37,400 --> 00:37:38,160
Jinzhao, you…

848
00:37:38,160 --> 00:37:38,880
I didn't expect you

849
00:37:38,880 --> 00:37:40,240
to know pawnshop rules so well,

850
00:37:40,560 --> 00:37:42,080
even that kind of loan sharking math.

851
00:37:45,160 --> 00:37:45,640
Well,

852
00:37:46,520 --> 00:37:47,840
at that rate,

853
00:37:48,000 --> 00:37:49,200
I'm afraid I won't be able to pay it back.

854
00:37:51,040 --> 00:37:52,200
Are you out of your mind?

855
00:37:52,560 --> 00:37:54,360
That jade bracelet was
a gift from you anyway.

856
00:37:54,760 --> 00:37:55,680
Even if you can't repay it,

857
00:37:55,840 --> 00:37:56,680
what's there to fear?

858
00:37:58,640 --> 00:37:59,320
Oh, right!

859
00:37:59,640 --> 00:38:00,440
I really was being silly.

860
00:38:01,440 --> 00:38:02,160
Thank you, Jinzhao.

861
00:38:02,360 --> 00:38:02,880
Alright.

862
00:38:05,520 --> 00:38:06,640
If no objections,

863
00:38:06,880 --> 00:38:07,960
just sign and press your seal.

864
00:38:08,600 --> 00:38:09,120
Okay.

865
00:38:34,000 --> 00:38:35,080
Same handwriting,

866
00:38:36,200 --> 00:38:37,400
same fingerprint.

867
00:38:39,880 --> 00:38:40,560
This pawn ticket

868
00:38:40,920 --> 00:38:41,720
really is yours.

869
00:38:41,920 --> 00:38:42,400
This…

870
00:38:42,520 --> 00:38:43,000
You…

871
00:38:43,920 --> 00:38:44,480
Wait,

872
00:38:45,200 --> 00:38:46,040
I specifically skipped

873
00:38:46,040 --> 00:38:47,080
Ji's pawnshop

874
00:38:47,280 --> 00:38:48,280
and went to He's,

875
00:38:48,480 --> 00:38:49,040
how did you…

876
00:38:49,040 --> 00:38:50,120
You didn't know.

877
00:38:50,400 --> 00:38:51,360
He's Pawnshop

878
00:38:51,520 --> 00:38:52,800
also has a 30% share from the Ji family.

879
00:38:54,960 --> 00:38:56,200
An official kiln vase

880
00:38:56,800 --> 00:38:58,080
and a jade ring,

881
00:38:58,600 --> 00:38:59,920
valued at 150 taels.

882
00:39:03,000 --> 00:39:04,400
What do you need so much silver for?

883
00:39:04,960 --> 00:39:06,480
Is it also for your classmate's sister's

884
00:39:06,760 --> 00:39:07,480
dowry?

885
00:39:08,320 --> 00:39:09,360
This is…

886
00:39:10,080 --> 00:39:10,680
Say it!

887
00:39:11,280 --> 00:39:12,560
What are you borrowing so much money for?

888
00:39:13,120 --> 00:39:14,520
You've even learned to pawn things now!

889
00:39:15,520 --> 00:39:16,600
If you lie,

890
00:39:16,680 --> 00:39:17,640
I'll take this ticket

891
00:39:17,880 --> 00:39:18,920
straight to mother

892
00:39:19,280 --> 00:39:20,160
or even father!

893
00:39:20,160 --> 00:39:20,720
No!

894
00:39:21,480 --> 00:39:22,040
Jinzhao,

895
00:39:22,040 --> 00:39:23,440
please don't tell them!

896
00:39:24,200 --> 00:39:25,200
I'll tell you.

897
00:39:27,960 --> 00:39:29,760
Actually…

898
00:39:30,200 --> 00:39:31,640
It was the month before last,

899
00:39:32,120 --> 00:39:33,840
a classmate of mine was
going back to his hometown

900
00:39:34,120 --> 00:39:35,600
and invited us over for a drink.

901
00:39:36,200 --> 00:39:37,440
I accidentally broke

902
00:39:37,560 --> 00:39:38,560
a teacup there.

903
00:39:39,240 --> 00:39:40,200
What teacup

904
00:39:40,560 --> 00:39:42,160
costs 150 taels of silver?

905
00:39:43,280 --> 00:39:44,520
It's Chenghua doucai kiln!

906
00:39:45,000 --> 00:39:46,320
That jade thumb ring

907
00:39:46,600 --> 00:39:47,840
was from mother.

908
00:39:48,280 --> 00:39:49,720
The pawn deadline is coming up,

909
00:39:49,920 --> 00:39:51,080
and I don't have money to redeem it.

910
00:39:51,680 --> 00:39:53,280
So I came to ask you for a loan.

911
00:39:53,840 --> 00:39:55,040
Whatever it takes,

912
00:39:55,040 --> 00:39:56,320
I have to get it back.

913
00:39:59,040 --> 00:39:59,600
Really.

914
00:40:01,520 --> 00:40:02,240
Qingpu,

915
00:40:03,440 --> 00:40:04,880
bring a 200 tael bank draft.

916
00:40:05,680 --> 00:40:07,160
Yes, Miss.

917
00:40:08,440 --> 00:40:09,600
Thank you, Jinzhao!

918
00:40:24,680 --> 00:40:26,160
First a classmate's sister,

919
00:40:26,760 --> 00:40:28,160
then an imperial kiln teacup.

920
00:40:28,560 --> 00:40:29,640
All nonsense.

921
00:40:31,080 --> 00:40:31,720
Qingpu,

922
00:40:32,040 --> 00:40:33,200
ask Mr. Ping to send two men

923
00:40:33,440 --> 00:40:34,400
to watch him closely.

924
00:40:35,160 --> 00:40:36,240
I want to see

925
00:40:36,520 --> 00:40:37,720
what he's really doing.

926
00:40:38,200 --> 00:40:39,160
Yes, Miss.

927
00:40:52,720 --> 00:40:53,800
Watch out!

928
00:40:55,600 --> 00:40:56,480
What happened?

929
00:40:57,480 --> 00:40:58,040
My lord,

930
00:40:58,240 --> 00:40:59,200
someone almost hit us.

931
00:41:00,720 --> 00:41:01,600
When did the capital

932
00:41:01,600 --> 00:41:02,760
get so polite?

933
00:41:03,080 --> 00:41:04,160
Not even a curse.

934
00:41:06,440 --> 00:41:07,480
No wonder,

935
00:41:07,840 --> 00:41:09,280
he's rushing off to gamble.

936
00:41:11,720 --> 00:41:12,840
A gambling house.

937
00:41:15,720 --> 00:41:16,680
No signboard?

938
00:41:17,080 --> 00:41:18,080
You don't know, my lord.

939
00:41:18,440 --> 00:41:19,280
The more hidden it is,

940
00:41:19,520 --> 00:41:20,480
the bigger the business.

941
00:41:21,160 --> 00:41:22,480
It must have backing.

942
00:41:23,840 --> 00:41:24,760
Whoever runs this

943
00:41:24,760 --> 00:41:25,440
is really shady.

944
00:41:27,200 --> 00:41:27,760
Go.

945
00:41:27,760 --> 00:41:28,560
Let's go, this way.

946
00:41:28,560 --> 00:41:29,120
It's near.

947
00:41:29,280 --> 00:41:30,440
Masters, please come in.

948
00:41:30,440 --> 00:41:31,400
[Good luck today.]

949
00:41:31,400 --> 00:41:32,440
Gu Jinrong?

950
00:41:35,040 --> 00:41:35,880
Didn't expect him

951
00:41:35,880 --> 00:41:36,960
to be a gambler.

952
00:41:37,960 --> 00:41:39,280
Turns out he is.

953
00:41:40,160 --> 00:41:41,240
Wonder if Miss Gu

954
00:41:41,240 --> 00:41:42,400
knows about this.

955
00:41:43,040 --> 00:41:44,160
She definitely doesn't.

956
00:41:44,720 --> 00:41:45,760
Otherwise, with her temper,

957
00:41:46,280 --> 00:41:47,480
she'd kill him.

958
00:41:51,520 --> 00:41:52,280
Let's go.

959
00:41:54,320 --> 00:41:54,800
Go.

960
00:42:02,560 --> 00:42:03,320
So,

961
00:42:03,800 --> 00:42:05,240
he's not gambling himself,

962
00:42:05,800 --> 00:42:07,880
he's recruiting for the gambling house?

963
00:42:08,160 --> 00:42:08,960
Exactly.

964
00:42:09,120 --> 00:42:10,280
I saw it myself.

965
00:42:10,440 --> 00:42:12,000
Mr. Jingrong didn't play,

966
00:42:12,280 --> 00:42:13,920
he led those gamblers

967
00:42:13,920 --> 00:42:14,840
into a private room.

968
00:42:15,320 --> 00:42:16,040
So,

969
00:42:16,240 --> 00:42:17,840
he's working for the gambling house

970
00:42:18,320 --> 00:42:19,400
as a frontman.

971
00:42:19,720 --> 00:42:21,000
A frontman.

972
00:42:21,840 --> 00:42:22,760
Normally,

973
00:42:22,760 --> 00:42:23,840
that should pay well.

974
00:42:24,200 --> 00:42:25,960
Then why does he still pawn things?

975
00:42:26,120 --> 00:42:27,080
Because that private room

976
00:42:27,080 --> 00:42:28,720
was rented by him.

977
00:42:28,960 --> 00:42:30,080
Gambling house rules say,

978
00:42:30,080 --> 00:42:30,840
to lease a room,

979
00:42:30,840 --> 00:42:32,440
one should pay three months upfront.

980
00:42:33,120 --> 00:42:34,600
Mr. Jingrong

981
00:42:34,600 --> 00:42:35,600
must be short on money,

982
00:42:35,880 --> 00:42:36,880
that's why

983
00:42:37,080 --> 00:42:38,120
he pawned things.

984
00:42:39,680 --> 00:42:40,400
I see.

985
00:42:41,040 --> 00:42:43,160
This needs to be handled fast.

986
00:42:44,120 --> 00:42:46,000
Even if he doesn't gamble himself,

987
00:42:46,560 --> 00:42:47,880
luring others in is worse

988
00:42:48,360 --> 00:42:50,280
than gambling himself.

989
00:42:54,240 --> 00:42:55,160
The Ministry of Rites

990
00:42:55,160 --> 00:42:56,600
sent the imperial exam pass list
for this round.

991
00:43:00,080 --> 00:43:00,680
Sir,

992
00:43:01,200 --> 00:43:02,920
people are talking outside,

993
00:43:03,840 --> 00:43:04,640
saying Mr. Xuanqing

994
00:43:04,640 --> 00:43:05,760
has your backing.

995
00:43:06,160 --> 00:43:07,080
He'll likely rank top

996
00:43:07,480 --> 00:43:08,560
in the palace exam.

997
00:43:09,360 --> 00:43:10,400
Too much attention

998
00:43:11,000 --> 00:43:12,000
may not be a good thing.

999
00:43:12,240 --> 00:43:12,880
Then,

1000
00:43:13,640 --> 00:43:14,400
can we stop it?

1001
00:43:14,720 --> 00:43:15,520
How can we?

1002
00:43:17,800 --> 00:43:18,840
If His Majesty and my teacher

1003
00:43:18,840 --> 00:43:20,000
both intend to promote him,

1004
00:43:20,800 --> 00:43:21,880
how could I

1005
00:43:22,120 --> 00:43:23,080
refuse their goodwill?

1006
00:43:26,720 --> 00:43:27,480
Sir,

1007
00:43:27,840 --> 00:43:29,160
the Ji family sent gifts.

1008
00:43:29,320 --> 00:43:30,000
Leave them there.

1009
00:43:36,120 --> 00:43:37,360
According to Mr. Luo,

1010
00:43:37,520 --> 00:43:39,160
these were personally chosen

1011
00:43:39,160 --> 00:43:40,000
by Miss Gu.

1012
00:43:40,080 --> 00:43:41,160
He said they were not enough

1013
00:43:41,160 --> 00:43:42,600
to repay you for saving Miss Gu,

1014
00:43:43,360 --> 00:43:44,960
just a token of gratitude

1015
00:43:45,400 --> 00:43:47,160
and to ease their own conscience.

1016
00:43:48,360 --> 00:43:49,760
He's got a silver tongue.

1017
00:43:53,880 --> 00:43:54,520
This is…

1018
00:43:55,080 --> 00:43:56,200
A double-barreled telescope!

1019
00:43:59,080 --> 00:44:00,080
Much clearer

1020
00:44:00,080 --> 00:44:00,920
than the single-tube one.

1021
00:44:01,640 --> 00:44:03,120
The Ji family is wealthy.

1022
00:44:03,520 --> 00:44:05,400
When Fujian opened trade back then,

1023
00:44:05,400 --> 00:44:06,080
they also

1024
00:44:06,080 --> 00:44:07,440
took a share of the profits.

1025
00:44:08,280 --> 00:44:09,440
Half the Western goods

1026
00:44:09,440 --> 00:44:10,880
you see in the capital now

1027
00:44:11,240 --> 00:44:12,640
are brought in

1028
00:44:12,840 --> 00:44:14,360
by the Ji family's merchant ships.

1029
00:44:15,200 --> 00:44:16,680
Miss Gu really put thought into this.

1030
00:44:22,200 --> 00:44:22,880
What is this?

1031
00:44:23,320 --> 00:44:24,640
Looks like…

1032
00:44:24,960 --> 00:44:25,800
a pair of eyeglasses.

1033
00:44:26,080 --> 00:44:26,760
I've heard of them.

1034
00:44:27,120 --> 00:44:28,880
For people with poor eyesight, right?

1035
00:44:33,240 --> 00:44:35,200
Are you sure Mr. Luo said

1036
00:44:36,120 --> 00:44:37,200
these gifts were all

1037
00:44:37,200 --> 00:44:38,760
chosen by Miss Gu herself?

1038
00:44:39,160 --> 00:44:39,880
Yes.

1039
00:44:40,600 --> 00:44:41,920
They also said

1040
00:44:42,720 --> 00:44:44,640
those were things you could use.

1041
00:44:45,920 --> 00:44:46,760
Throw them all out.

1042
00:44:47,840 --> 00:44:48,640
Yes.

1043
00:44:52,880 --> 00:44:53,800
Forget it.

